@startuml
title Passing the IOU — nobody pays the big bill until the very end
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F3EEFB
  BorderColor #7A5BB5
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F3EEFB
  DiamondBorderColor #7A5BB5
  ArrowColor #7A5BB5
  StartColor #7A5BB5
  EndColor #7A5BB5
}

start
:dinner 1: do the quick checks;
:write an IOU for the expensive part;
:hand the IOU to tomorrow's friend;

repeat
  :next dinner: do the quick checks for today;
  :merge today's IOU into yesterday's;
  :the merged note is still one small note;
repeat while (another dinner tomorrow?) is (yes) not (no)

:the last friend reads the single merged IOU;
:pay the expensive bill, once;
if (does the bill add up?) then (yes)
  :every dinner was paid for honestly;
else (no)
  :something was wrong, reject the whole year;
endif
stop
@enduml
